sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 利用者
    participant Console as interactive.py<br/>対話ターミナル

    box rgb(218, 247, 232) 共通Evidence層（1回だけ）
    participant Evidence as evidence/pipeline.py<br/>EvidencePipeline
    participant Fluency as audio_pipeline.py<br/>FluencyExtractor
    end

    box rgb(221, 235, 255) 共通モジュール実行層
    participant Runner as fact_modules.py<br/>run_fact_modules()
    end

    box rgb(232, 245, 233) 事実モジュール（相互に独立）
    participant Range as range.py<br/>RangeExtractor
    participant Accuracy as accuracy.py<br/>AccuracyModule
    participant Coherence as coherence.py<br/>CoherenceModule
    end

    box rgb(220, 236, 255) 評価層（ここだけが評価）
    participant Judge as AI Judge
    participant Delib as deliberation.py<br/>CEFR協議
    end

    User->>Console: 音声を選択
    Console->>Evidence: build(audio_path)
    Evidence->>Fluency: 音声を解析
    Fluency-->>Evidence: 文字起こし・VAD・ポーズ・モーラ時刻
    Evidence->>Evidence: Sudachiトークン化（1回）
    Evidence-->>Console: EvidenceBundle v1
    Console->>Console: 共通Evidence層を表示

    Console->>Runner: run_fact_modules(evidence,<br/>Range + Accuracy + Coherence)
    Note over Runner,Coherence: 3モジュールは同じEvidenceを読み、互いを呼ばない
    Runner->>Range: LinguisticEvidence
    Runner->>Accuracy: EvidenceBundle
    Runner->>Coherence: EvidenceBundle
    Range-->>Runner: range_data
    Accuracy-->>Runner: accuracy_data
    Coherence-->>Runner: coherence_data
    Runner-->>Console: FactModuleRun（3パケット）
    Console->>Console: Range / Accuracy / Coherenceを表示

    Console->>Judge: 基礎事実 + 3パケット
    Judge-->>Delib: CEFR推定
    Delib-->>Console: 最終推定・人間確認要否
    Console-->>User: 表示・履歴保存
